  - CONTEXT SIDEBAR (4 visible, scrolls): situational observation buttons added one at a time via add_context_button(button). Oldest scrolls out. Don't duplicate USER RESPONSE BOARD labels.

When you build response buttons, draw on conversation history, known interests, and recent observations — include callbacks to earlier topics, not just the latest event.
</board>

